  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LHRC verksamhetsst&#xf6;d 2013-2018                    Legal and Human Rights Centre</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal and Human Rights Centre, core supp 2013-2018 - Legal and Human Rights Centre, LHRC 2013-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Citizen-centered constitution achieved and all laws reviewed to be consistent with the new constitution.
2. Improved laws, policies and practises that are human rights sensitive.
3. Reduced human rights violations and injustices.
4. Government and corporate compliance with regional and international standards with regards to economic, social and environmental rights increased.
5. A relevant, sustainable and high impact LHRC.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Legal and Human Rights Centre (LHRC)for their         Strategic plan 2013-2018, phase 1 (2013-2015). Continued Swedish      support, started in 2001. The objectives are to reduce HR violations, enhance women&apos;s and men&apos;s knowledge of human rights and their ability &amp; conditions to defend their rights, as well as strengthening the     capacity of duty-bearers to respect human rights.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till Legal and Human Rights Centre (LHRC)f&#xf6;r deras    strategiska plan 2013-2018, fas 1 (2013-2015). Forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5;        svenskt st&#xf6;d som inleddes 2001. M&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att minska MR-kr&#xe4;nkningar, &#xf6;ka m&#xe4;nniskors kunskap om MR och f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar att f&#xf6;rsvara sina        r&#xe4;ttigheter, och st&#xe4;rka myndigheters kapacitet att som duty-bearers   respektera MR.</narrative>
  </description>
